          "id": "ch-3-master-formula-table-unit-2",
          "number": "3",
          "title": "Master Formula Table (Unit 2)",
          "markdown": "## 3. Master Formula Table (Unit 2)\n\n| Quantity | Formula | SI / Practical Units |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Boltzmann population ratio | $\\frac{N_2}{N_1} = e^{-(E_2 - E_1)/(k_B T)} = e^{-h\\nu/(k_B T)}$ | Dimensionless |\n| Einstein's relations | $B_{12} = B_{21}$, $\\frac{A_{21}}{B_{21}} = \\frac{8\\pi h \\nu^3}{c^3}$ | $A_{21}$ in $\\text{s}^{-1}$ |\n| Coherence length & time | $L_c = c\\tau_c$, $\\tau_c = \\frac{L_c}{c}$ | $\\text{m}$, $\\text{s}$ |\n| Critical angle (core–cladding) | $\\theta_c = \\sin^{-1}(n_2 / n_1)$ | $\\text{deg}$ or $\\text{rad}$ |\n| Numerical Aperture (NA) | $\\text{NA} = \\sqrt{n_1^2 - n_2^2} \\approx n_1\\sqrt{2\\Delta}$ | Dimensionless |\n| Acceptance angle (in air, $n_0=1$) | $\\theta_a = \\sin^{-1}(\\text{NA})$ | $\\text{deg}$ or $\\text{rad}$ |\n| Normalized frequency ($V$-number) | $V = \\frac{2\\pi a}{\\lambda}\\text{NA} = \\frac{\\pi d}{\\lambda}\\text{NA}$ | Dimensionless |\n| Guided modes (step-index MMF) | $M \\approx \\frac{V^2}{2}$ (single mode if $V < 2.405$) | Count |\n| Fibre attenuation ($\\alpha$) | $\\alpha = \\frac{10}{L}\\log_{10}\\!\\left(\\frac{P_{\\text{in}}}{P_{\\text{out}}}\\right)$, $P_{\\text{out}} = P_{\\text{in}}10^{-\\alpha L/10}$ | $\\text{dB/km}$, $L$ in $\\text{km}$ |"
